---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About / Meet James"
  description="Meet James of Honest Acres Group — a Texas land specialist and working rancher who works the land he sells."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>He doesn't just sell ranch land. He works it.</h1>

      <p>{SITE.shortProfile}</p>

      <h2>Meet James</h2>
      <p>
        James is based in Dallas, Texas, and runs a working
        ranch in Comanche County with cattle and Bermuda hay fields. That daily, hands-on
        experience is the foundation of Honest Acres Group: when James walks a
        property with a buyer, he reads it the way a rancher does — grass,
        water, soils, fences, and what the place will actually do across a
        full year of Texas weather, not just how it looks on showing day.
      </p>
      <p>
        As an honest fiduciary, James's job is to give buyers and sellers of
        farm, ranch, and recreational land straight advice — including when
        the straight advice is "this isn't the right tract" or "this isn't
        the right price." That's the deal, every time.
      </p>
      <p>
        And when he's not selling real estate or ranching, you'll find him on
        the fairway — playing the local courses across the counties he serves
        and reporting back through our <a href="/fairways-and-fences/">Fairways
        &amp; Fences</a> series, so buyers can see what life in each county
        actually looks like.
      </p>

      <h2>About Honest Acres Group</h2>
      <p>
        Honest Acres Group is a Texas real estate group specializing in farm,
        ranch, and recreational properties, {SITE.brokerage.footerLine}.
        Our home ground is the Cross Timbers and the North Hill Country, and
        our standard is in our name: honest land, honest advice.
      </p>

      <p>
        {SITE.agent.name}{SITE.agent.isRealtor ? ', REALTOR®' : ''} · Texas Lic. #{SITE.agent.license} ·
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.agent.email}`}>{SITE.agent.email}</a>
      </p>
      <p><a class="btn btn-green" href="/contact/">Get in touch</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
